### Geo-Tagged Evidence Upload Modal
![Evidence Upload Modal](file:///C:/Users/prasa/.gemini/antigravity-ide/brain/9094e599-1826-476d-a610-53dc45794e06/chef_evidence_upload_modal_1789838807484.png)

On clicking **Evidence** on any pending SOP:
- GPS is **requested immediately** when the modal opens (browser permission prompt)
- Shows a status bar: `Location Acquired ✓` with lat/lng coordinates + accuracy radius
- Coordinates are shown in the bar: `13.128707, 80.257145 ±129m` + a `Map ↗` link (opens Google Maps)
- Camera-first file input (mobile: opens camera; desktop: file picker)
- Preview shows the photo with **coordinates & timestamp embedded** as an overlay
- Metadata summary: Chef name, captured time, Geo-Tag status
- On submit: evidence stored + SOP task auto-marked as Completed

